    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[First-call resolution is not luck. It is the direct result of structure, training, and the right customer experience strategy. For organizations that aim to build loyalty and reduce operational friction, few metrics matter more than resolving an issue the first time a customer reaches out.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
